        "format": 1,
        "content": "<img class=\"sbn-retrato\" src=\"modules/seattle-by-night/assets/retratos/PJ-06.webp\" alt=\"Dr. Ruth Abernathy\">\n<p class=\"sbn-enlace-actor\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-user\"></i> Sheet: @UUID[Actor.9Sei2feAoKaQPPto]{Dr. Ruth Abernathy}</p>\n<p><strong>Concept:</strong> night-shift pathologist at the county medical examiner&#39;s office and a member of Voight&#39;s chantry.</p>\n"
